  "siteName": "The Keyword (blog.google) ",
  "content": "<html>\n <head></head>\n <body>\n  <div class=\"loader-mask\"></div>\n  <main id=\"jump-content\" class=\"site-content\" tabindex=\"-1\">\n   <div class=\"uni-layout-page uni-component-spacing short-post-page\">\n    <div class=\"short-post-page__grid\">\n     <div class=\"short-post-page__breadcrumb\">\n      <div class=\"breadcrumb__container\" data-component=\"uni-breadcrumb\" data-component-initialized=\"true\">\n       <button class=\"breadcrumb__prev-btn hide\" aria-label=\"Previous\"></button>\n       <button class=\"breadcrumb__next-btn hide\" aria-label=\"Next\"></button>\n      </div>\n     </div>\n     <div class=\"short-post-page__post\">\n      <uni-short-post data-title=\"We’re boosting agroforestry efforts to help the atmosphere and farmer livelihoods.\" author=\"Randy Spock\" author-job-title=\"Head of Carbon Credits and Removals\" author-url=\"\" date=\"Jul 08, 2026\" url=\"https://blog.google/company-news/outreach-and-initiatives/sustainability/thryve-earth-agroforestry/\" component-type=\"image_full_width\">\n       <!---->\n       <div class=\"short-post\">\n        <div class=\"short-post__header\">\n         <div class=\"uni-author-info short-post__author\">\n          <!--?lit$0320454157$-->\n          <!--?lit$0320454157$-->\n          By <!--?lit$0320454157$-->\n          <span><!--?lit$0320454157$-->Randy Spock</span> <!--?lit$0320454157$-->\n           | <!--?lit$0320454157$-->\n           Head of Carbon Credits and Removals<!--?-->\n          <!--?-->\n         </div>\n         <div class=\"uni-body--small short-post__date\">\n          <!--?lit$0320454157$-->\n          Jul 08, 2026\n         </div>\n         <button tooltip=\"Copied\" aria-label=\"Copy to clipboard\" class=\"short-post__copy-link\"><uni-icon-component icon-id=\"social-link\"><!----></uni-icon-component></button>\n        </div>\n        <!--?lit$0320454157$-->\n        <!--?lit$0320454157$-->\n        <!--?lit$0320454157$-->\n        <!--?-->\n        <!--?-->\n        <p class=\"short-post__description\" data-analytics-module=\"{&quot;module_name&quot;:&quot;Paragraph&quot;,&quot;section_header&quot;:&quot;We’re boosting agroforestry efforts to help the atmosphere and farmer livelihoods.&quot;}\"><!--?lit$0320454157$--></p>\n        <div slot=\"uni-short-post-description-slot\" style=\"display: block;\">\n         <div class=\"rich-text\">\n          <p data-block-key=\"tmcw5\">Today, through the <a href=\"https://www.symbiosiscoalition.org/\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">Symbiosis Coalition</a>, we’re announcing a long-term agreement with <a href=\"https://www.thryve.earth/\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">Thryve.Earth</a> for 260,000 tons of carbon removal from their agroforestry project in Sulawesi, Indonesia. This marks the first agroforestry project included within Google’s carbon removal program.</p>\n          <p data-block-key=\"6cq44\">Thryve’s approach restores heavily degraded land by replacing fire-prone, invasive grasses with a resilient, multi-layered farming system. By blending an upper canopy of sugar palm and timber trees, a mid-layer of fruit crops like avocado and coffee, and ground-level annual crops such as chili and corn, the project both removes carbon and benefits local farmers, all while simultaneously replenishing the soil and increasing local biodiversity.</p>\n          <p data-block-key=\"b5hom\">Together with Symbiosis, we’re continuing to catalyze the highest-scale opportunities to restore natural ecosystems worldwide. It’s one element of our broader <a href=\"https://cdrxiv.org/preprint/521\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">climate solutions portfolio</a>, which also includes other <a href=\"https://blog.google/company-news/outreach-and-initiatives/sustainability/frontier-funding-expansion/\">breakthrough carbon removal</a> projects and efforts to <a href=\"https://blog.google/company-news/outreach-and-initiatives/sustainability/pledge-to-fight-superpollutants-2030/\">eliminate superpollutants.</a></p>\n         </div>\n        </div>\n        <p></p>\n        <!--?lit$0320454157$-->\n        <div class=\" short-post__child-component \">\n         <!--?lit$0320454157$-->\n         <div slot=\"uni-short-post-slot\" style=\"display: block;\">\n          <div class=\"block-image_full_width\">\n           <uni-image-full-width alignment=\"full\" alt-text=\"Agroforestry project in Sulawesi, Indonesia\" external-image=\"\" or-mp4-video-title=\"\" or-mp4-video-url=\"\" section-header=\"We’re boosting agroforestry efforts to help the atmosphere and farmer livelihoods.\" autoplay=\"true\">\n            <!---->\n            <div class=\"image-full-width image-full-width--full \" data-analytics-module=\"{&quot;module_name&quot;:&quot;Inline Images&quot;,&quot;section_header&quot;:&quot;We’re boosting agroforestry efforts to help the atmosphere and farmer livelihoods.&quot;}\">\n             <!--?lit$0320454157$-->\n             <!--?lit$0320454157$-->\n             <div class=\" image-full-width__media-asset \">\n              <!--?lit$0320454157$-->\n              <div slot=\"image-slot\" style=\"display: block;\">\n               <img alt=\"Agroforestry project in Sulawesi, Indonesia\" src=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/gweb-uniblog-publish-prod/images/Thryve_Symbiosis_herosocial.width-1000.format-webp.webp\" loading=\"lazy\" data-loading=\"{\n            &quot;mobile&quot;: &quot;https://storage.googleapis.com/gweb-uniblog-publish-prod/images/Thryve_Symbiosis_herosocial.width-500.format-webp.webp&quot;,\n            &quot;desktop&quot;: &quot;https://storage.googleapis.com/gweb-uniblog-publish-prod/images/Thryve_Symbiosis_herosocial.width-1000.format-webp.webp&quot;\n          }\" class=\"lazy-image--no-blur\">\n              </div>\n              <!--?lit$0320454157$-->\n              <!--?lit$0320454157$-->\n              <!--?-->\n              <!--?lit$0320454157$-->\n              <!--?lit$0320454157$-->\n              <!--?-->\n              <!--?lit$0320454157$-->\n              <!--?lit$0320454157$-->\n              <!--?-->\n             </div>\n             <!--?-->\n             <!--?lit$0320454157$-->\n             <!--?lit$0320454157$-->\n             <!--?-->\n            </div>\n           </uni-image-full-width>\n          </div>\n         </div>\n        </div>\n       </div>\n      </uni-short-post>\n     </div>\n     <div class=\"short-post-page__related-articles\">\n      <h2 class=\"uni-headline-5 short-post-page__related-articles-title\">Related stories</h2>\n      <ul class=\"short-post-page__related-articles-list\">\n       <li>\n        <uni-short-related-post authors=\"Christopher Van Arsdale\" index=\"0\" primary-tag=\"Topics - Google Research\" summary=\"Three new FireSat satellites have launched, expanding a network that uses Google AI to help fire agencies detect early-stage wildfires.\" title=\"Three new satellites join the fight against wildfires.\" url=\"https://blog.google/innovation-and-ai/models-and-research/google-research/firesat-satellites/\" ga4-context=\"{\n                  &quot;module_name&quot;: &quot;Short Post Related articles&quot;,\n                  &quot;section_header&quot;: &quot;Related stories&quot;,\n                  &quot;content_type&quot;: &quot;Short Post&quot;\n                }\">\n         <!---->\n         <div class=\"short-post-page__related-article short-post-page__related-article--underline\">\n          <a class=\"short-post-page__related-article-link\" href=\"https://blog.google/innovation-and-ai/models-and-research/google-research/firesat-satellites/\"> \n           <h3 class=\"uni-title-2 short-post-page__related-article-title\"><!--?lit$0320454157$-->Three new satellites join the fight against wildfires.</h3> \n           <!--?lit$0320454157$--> \n           <p class=\"uni-body--small short-post-page__related-article-body\"><!--?lit$0320454157$-->Three new FireSat satellites have launched, expanding a network that uses Google AI to help fire agencies detect early-stage wildfires.</p> \n          </a>\n         </div>\n        </uni-short-related-post>\n       </li>\n       <li>\n        <uni-short-related-post authors=\"Kate Brandt\" index=\"1\" primary-tag=\"Topics - Sustainability\" summary=\"Today, we’re releasing our 11th Environmental Report, which provides a holistic view of our 2025 sustainability performance.\" title=\"Read our 11th annual Environmental Report\" url=\"https://blog.google/company-news/outreach-and-initiatives/sustainability/2026-environmental-report/\" ga4-context=\"{\n                  &quot;module_name&quot;: &quot;Short Post Related articles&quot;,\n                  &quot;section_header&quot;: &quot;Related stories&quot;,\n                  &quot;content_type&quot;: &quot;article page&quot;\n                }\">\n         <!---->\n         <div class=\"short-post-page__related-article short-post-page__related-article--underline\">\n          <a class=\"short-post-page__related-article-link\" href=\"https://blog.google/company-news/outreach-and-initiatives/sustainability/2026-environmental-report/\"> \n           <h3 class=\"uni-title-2 short-post-page__related-article-title\"><!--?lit$0320454157$-->Read our 11th annual Environmental Report</h3> \n           <!--?lit$0320454157$--> \n          </a>\n         </div>\n        </uni-short-related-post>\n       </li>\n       <li>\n        <uni-short-related-post authors=\"Nathan Gassmann, Chris Alwan\" index=\"2\" primary-tag=\"Topics - Sustainability\" summary=\"Google safely deconstructed a WWII airship hangar and salvaged the wood for a campus in Oregon.\" title=\"How timber from a WWII airship hangar became part of Google campuses\" url=\"https://blog.google/company-news/outreach-and-initiatives/sustainability/wwii-airship-hangar/\" ga4-context=\"{\n                  &quot;module_name&quot;: &quot;Short Post Related articles&quot;,\n                  &quot;section_header&quot;: &quot;Related stories&quot;,\n                  &quot;content_type&quot;: &quot;article page&quot;\n                }\">\n         <!---->\n         <div class=\"short-post-page__related-article short-post-page__related-article--underline\">\n          <a class=\"short-post-page__related-article-link\" href=\"https://blog.google/company-news/outreach-and-initiatives/sustainability/wwii-airship-hangar/\"> \n           <h3 class=\"uni-title-2 short-post-page__related-article-title\"><!--?lit$0320454157$-->How timber from a WWII airship hangar became part of Google campuses</h3> \n           <!--?lit$0320454157$--> \n          </a>\n         </div>\n        </uni-short-related-post>\n       </li>\n       <li>\n        <uni-short-related-post authors=\"Randy Spock\" index=\"3\" primary-tag=\"Topics - Sustainability\" summary=\"By renewing our support for Frontier, we are advancing a portfolio that tackles emissions at every timescale.\" title=\"We’re expanding our support for breakthrough carbon removal technologies.\" url=\"https://blog.google/company-news/outreach-and-initiatives/sustainability/frontier-funding-expansion/\" ga4-context=\"{\n                  &quot;module_name&quot;: &quot;Short Post Related articles&quot;,\n                  &quot;section_header&quot;: &quot;Related stories&quot;,\n                  &quot;content_type&quot;: &quot;Short Post&quot;\n                }\">\n         <!---->\n         <div class=\"short-post-page__related-article\">\n          <a class=\"short-post-page__related-article-link\" href=\"https://blog.google/company-news/outreach-and-initiatives/sustainability/frontier-funding-expansion/\"> \n           <h3 class=\"uni-title-2 short-post-page__related-article-title\"><!--?lit$0320454157$-->We’re expanding our support for breakthrough carbon removal technologies.</h3> \n           <!--?lit$0320454157$--> \n          </a>\n         </div>\n        </uni-short-related-post>\n       </li>\n      </ul>\n     </div>\n    </div>\n   </div>\n  </main>\n  <div class=\"uni-newsletter-toast\" data-component=\"uni-newsletter-toast\" data-component-initialized=\"true\" style=\"bottom: -63.0938px;\">\n   <div class=\"h-c-page\">\n    <div class=\"uni-newsletter-toast--container h-c-grid\">\n     <div class=\"uni-newsletter-toast__info h-c-grid__col h-c-grid__col--12  h-c-grid__col-l--9 h-c-grid__col--align-middle\">\n      <div class=\"uni-newsletter-toast__img\">\n       <img src=\"https://blog.google/static/blogv2/images/newsletter_toast.svg?version=pr20260624-1707\" alt=\"\">\n      </div>\n      <p class=\"uni-newsletter-toast__text\">Let’s stay in touch. Get the latest news from Google in your inbox.</p>\n     </div>\n     <div class=\"uni-newsletter-toast__buttons h-c-grid__col h-c-grid__col--8 h-c-grid__col-l--3\">\n      <a class=\"uni-newsletter-toast__cta uni-newsletter-toast__cta--sub\" href=\"https://blog.google/newsletter-subscribe/\" tabindex=\"0\" aria-label=\"Newsletter subscribe\" data-content-type=\"blogv2 | Short Post\">Subscribe</a>\n      <button class=\"uni-newsletter-toast__cta uni-newsletter-toast__cta--no\" tabindex=\"0\" data-content-type=\"blogv2 | Short Post\">No thanks</button>\n     </div>\n    </div>\n   </div>\n  </div>\n </body>\n</html>",
  "aiSummary": "Google 宣布通过 Thryve.Earth 在印度尼西亚开展的农林复合项目，达成一项移除 260，000 吨碳的长期协议，旨在将环境修复与农民收益相结合。",
  "oneSentenceSummary": "Google 宣布通过 Thryve.Earth 在印度尼西亚开展的农林复合项目，达成一项移除 260，000 吨碳的长期协议，旨在将环境修复与农民收益相结合。",
  "summary": "本文宣布 Google 将通过 Symbiosis Coalition 与 Thryve.Earth 合作，在印度尼西亚苏拉威西开展一项 260，000 吨碳移除项目。文章详细介绍了农林复合（Agroforestry）的方法——通过种植多层作物（糖棕榈、果树、一年生作物）来取代易燃草地，从而修复退化土地、增强生物多样性并支持当地农民。该倡议是 Google 更广泛气候解决方案组合的一部分，其中包括其他碳移除项目和消除超强污染物（superpollutants）的努力。",
  "mainPoints": [
    {
      "point": "Google 与 Thryve.Earth 合作，通过在印度尼西亚开展农林复合项目实现 260，000 吨碳移除。",
      "explanation": "这标志着 Google 碳移除计划中首个农林复合项目，预示着向可扩展的自然气候解决方案转型。"
    },
    {
      "point": "该项目利用多层种植系统修复退化土地。",
      "explanation": "通过种植糖棕榈、果类作物和一年生作物，该项目取代了易燃草地，在移除碳的同时提升了土壤健康和生物多样性。"
    },
    {
      "point": "农林复合经营同时造福环境与当地农民。",
      "explanation": "在生态系统恢复的同时，农民能够获得多样化的收入来源，使经济激励与可持续发展目标保持一致。"
    },
    {
      "point": "该倡议是 Google 更广泛气候组合的一部分。",
      "explanation": "它与其他的碳移除项目及消除超强污染物的努力相辅相成，体现了 Google 对全面气候行动的承诺。"
    }
  ],
  "keyQuotes": [
    "通过结合糖棕榈和木材树木的上层林冠、牛油果和咖啡等果类作物的中层，以及辣椒和玉米等地面层一年生作物，该项目在移除碳的同时也使当地农民受益，并同步补充土壤肥力并增加当地的生物多样性。"
  ],
